 {
  "id": "fins_clock_read_bcd",
  "proto": "fins",
  "summary": "T-012: Clock Read（0x0701）无参数请求 + BCD 响应（世纪20/年26/月08/日18/时14/分30/秒00/星期02）；Wireshark 对 0x0701 响应不解析结束码，用 FrameAssert 校验",
  "spec_json": {
   "layers": [
    {
     "ip": {
      "src": "10.0.0.1",
      "dst": "20.0.0.1"
     }
    },
    {
     "udp": {
      "src_port": 1244,
      "dst_port": 9600
     }
    },
    {
     "fins": {
      "transport": "udp",
      "commands": [
       {
        "command": 1793,
        "clock": {
         "century": 20,
         "year": 26,
         "month": 8,
         "day": 18,
         "hour": 14,
         "minute": 30,
         "second": 0,
         "weekday": 2
        }
       }
      ]
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  "expect": {
   "packet_count": 2,
   "fields": [
    {
     "packet": 1,
     "field": "omron.command",
     "value": "0x0701"
    },
    {
     "packet": 1,
     "field": "omron.sid",
     "value": "0x01"
    },
    {
     "packet": 2,
     "field": "omron.icf",
     "value": "0xc0"
    },
    {
     "packet": 2,
     "field": "omron.command",
     "value": "0x0701"
    }
   ],
   "frames": [
    {
     "packet": 2,
     "offset": 54,
     "hex": "00 00 26 08 18 14 30 00 02"
    }
   ],
   "notes": [
    "Wireshark omron-fins dissector 0x0701 response = 10头+2命令码+2结束码+7 BCD(年/月/日/时/分/秒/星期)=21 字节，无世纪字段(century只进配置不上线)",
    "Wireshark 0x0701 分支不解析结束码（packet-omron-fins.c），故响应断言全用 FrameAssert",
    "BCD 小时=0x14（BCD SID 强制覆盖点，SID 本身为普通字节 0x01）",
    "请求帧=10+2=12 字节；FrameAssert 校验请求无参数（12 字节后无内容）"
   ]
  }
 },
 {
  "id": "fins_sessions_two",
  "proto": "fins",
  "summary": "T-020: 多会话 sessions=2 双流（各 DM D100 读 1 字），每流 SID 独立从 0x01 递增、跨流不串号；聚合断言 + 每流独立 src_port",
  "spec_json": {
   "layers": [
    {
     "ip": {
      "src": "10.0.0.1",
      "dst": "20.0.0.1"
     }
    },
    {
